      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Seared-Salmon-with-Guacamole-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash up the avocado with a fork.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-seared-salmon-with-guacamole/#wprm-recipe-54123-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Seared-Salmon-with-Guacamole-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the quarted cherry tomatoes and diced onion. Mix in the olive oil, lime juice, and salt and pepper. Stir until well combined.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-seared-salmon-with-guacamole/#wprm-recipe-54123-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Seared-Salmon-with-Guacamole-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season the salmon filets with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-seared-salmon-with-guacamole/#wprm-recipe-54123-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Seared-Salmon-with-Guacamole-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add the olive oil and the salmon filets. Sear them for 4-5 minutes or until they are done to your liking, on both sides.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-seared-salmon-with-guacamole/#wprm-recipe-54123-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Seared-Salmon-with-Guacamole-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve the salmon with the guacamole. Drizzle some lime juice over the top!",
